WEBVTT


1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.360
In as little as three minutes,

2
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.520
you could die from smoke inhalation.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.520
A working smoke alarm can save your life.

4
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.720
Test your smoke alarms regularly,

5
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.680
remove obvious dangers and have a planned escape.